       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EXWRAP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BASE-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 LEAF-STATUS PIC 99.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 WRAP-INPUT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 WRAP-OUTPUT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 WRAP-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WRAP-INPUT WRAP-OUTPUT WRAP-STATUS.
MAIN-WRAPPER.
    MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-OUTPUT WRAP-STATUS.
    MOVE ZERO TO BASE-AMOUNT LEAF-STATUS.
    PERFORM RUN-STEP THRU STEP-END.
    GOBACK.
RUN-STEP.
    CALL 'EXLEAF' USING BY CONTENT WRAP-INPUT
        BY REFERENCE BASE-AMOUNT LEAF-STATUS
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 91 TO WRAP-STATUS
            MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-OUTPUT
        NOT ON EXCEPTION
            IF LEAF-STATUS = ZERO
                COMPUTE WRAP-OUTPUT ROUNDED = BASE-AMOUNT * 2
                    ON SIZE ERROR
                        MOVE 24 TO WRAP-STATUS
                        MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-OUTPUT
                    NOT ON SIZE ERROR
                        MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-STATUS
                END-COMPUTE
            ELSE
                MOVE LEAF-STATUS TO WRAP-STATUS
                MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-OUTPUT
            END-IF
    END-CALL.
STEP-END.
    EXIT.
